{"id":"2e315868bd6a1509","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-realizability-fibration.md","title":"一致实现性纤维化","display":"df-realizability-fibration — 一致实现性纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-realizability-fibration","display":"df-realizability-fibration — 一致实现性纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-pca]]","[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-split-generic]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]"],"source":"Examples 4.2.6 and 5.3.2–5.3.4, pp. 331–334 (PDF 351–354)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-realizability-fibration"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-realizability-fibration"},{"key":"display","html":"df-realizability-fibration — 一致实现性纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5726b47e65d282e\" href=\"?note=d5726b47e65d282e\" title=\"16-df-pca\">16-df-pca</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2508bee9cd5dcead\" href=\"?note=2508bee9cd5dcead\" title=\"16-df-split-generic\">16-df-split-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Examples 4.2.6 and 5.3.2–5.3.4, pp. 331–334 (PDF 351–354)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-realizability-fibration</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\cdot)\">\\((A,\\cdot)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5726b47e65d282e\" href=\"?note=d5726b47e65d282e\" title=\"16-df-pca\">16-df-pca</a> 的 PCA，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\Omega=\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的带标签箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2508bee9cd5dcead\" href=\"?note=2508bee9cd5dcead\" title=\"16-df-split-generic\">16-df-split-generic</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>。</li>\n<li>可推导性定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\vdash_I\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\vdash_I\\psi\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in(\\mathcal P(A))^I\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in(\\mathcal P(A))^I\\)</span> 局部取所示定义域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\subseteq A\">\\(U,V\\subseteq A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\Rightarrow V\">\\(U\\Rightarrow V\\)</span> 在下文定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=(I,\\varphi)\">\\(Q=(I,\\varphi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=(J,\\psi)\">\\(R=(J,\\psi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(K,\\xi)\">\\(S=(K,\\xi)\\)</span> 是下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_A\">\\(O_A\\)</span> 的对象。总箭头携带源靶标签；固定 Hom 中简写为函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>纤维对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,\\varphi)\">\\((I,\\varphi)\\)</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi:I\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\varphi:I\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> 之间的双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_I^A,b_I^A\">\\(\\iota_I^A,b_I^A\\)</span> 在 Assertion 显式定义。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\\psi\">\\(u^*\\psi\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_I^A\\bigl(u^{*\\kappa_A}(\\iota_J^A\\psi)\\bigr)\">\\(b_I^A\\bigl(u^{*\\kappa_A}(\\iota_J^A\\psi)\\bigr)\\)</span>；纤维运算的裸谓词写法均通过这对互逆函数读取。指定分裂是下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_A\">\\(\\kappa_A\\)</span>。所有交集取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 内的交，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap_{i\\in\\varnothing}U_i=A\">\\(\\bigcap_{i\\in\\varnothing}U_i=A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\Rightarrow V\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A\\mid(\\forall b\\in U)\\ a\\cdot b\\downarrow\\land a\\cdot b\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\Rightarrow V\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A\\mid(\\forall b\\in U)\\ a\\cdot b\\downarrow\\land a\\cdot b\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,\\varphi)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\varphi:I\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\},\\\\\nM_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle\\mid Q=(I,\\varphi)\\in O_A\\land R=(J,\\psi)\\in O_A\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land u\\in J^I\\land(\\exists a\\in A)(\\forall i\\in I)\\ a\\in(\\varphi(i)\\Rightarrow\\psi(ui))\\},\\\\\ns_A\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq Q,\\qquad t_A\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle\\coloneqq R,\\\\\ne_A(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,Q,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_A(\\langle R,S,v\\rangle,\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,S,vu\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal R_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_A,M_A,s_A,t_A,e_A,c_A\\rangle,\\\\\n(r_A)_0(I,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\qquad (r_A)_1\\langle(I,\\varphi),(J,\\psi),u\\rangle\\coloneqq(I,J,u),\\\\\nr_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(r_A)_0,(r_A)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nu^*\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\psi\\circ u,\\\\\n\\kappa_A(u,(J,\\psi))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\psi\\circ u),(J,\\psi),u\\rangle,\\\\\n\\varphi\\vdash_I\\psi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigcap_{i\\in I}(\\varphi(i)\\Rightarrow\\psi(i))\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nG_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal P(A),\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal P(A)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal R_A)&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(r_A,\\mathcal R_A,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(r_A,\\kappa_A)&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{r_A}(G_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,\\varphi)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\varphi:I\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\},\\\\\nM_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle\\mid Q=(I,\\varphi)\\in O_A\\land R=(J,\\psi)\\in O_A\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land u\\in J^I\\land(\\exists a\\in A)(\\forall i\\in I)\\ a\\in(\\varphi(i)\\Rightarrow\\psi(ui))\\},\\\\\ns_A\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq Q,\\qquad t_A\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle\\coloneqq R,\\\\\ne_A(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,Q,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_A(\\langle R,S,v\\rangle,\\langle Q,R,u\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle Q,S,vu\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal R_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_A,M_A,s_A,t_A,e_A,c_A\\rangle,\\\\\n(r_A)_0(I,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\qquad (r_A)_1\\langle(I,\\varphi),(J,\\psi),u\\rangle\\coloneqq(I,J,u),\\\\\nr_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(r_A)_0,(r_A)_1\\rangle,\\\\\nu^*\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\psi\\circ u,\\\\\n\\kappa_A(u,(J,\\psi))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\psi\\circ u),(J,\\psi),u\\rangle,\\\\\n\\varphi\\vdash_I\\psi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigcap_{i\\in I}(\\varphi(i)\\Rightarrow\\psi(i))\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\nG_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal P(A),\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal P(A)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal R_A)&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(r_A,\\mathcal R_A,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(r_A,\\kappa_A)&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}_{r_A}(G_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_I^A&amp;:(\\mathcal P(A))^I\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathcal R_A)_I),\n&amp;\\iota_I^A(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,\\varphi),\\\\\nb_I^A&amp;:\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathcal R_A)_I)\\longrightarrow(\\mathcal P(A))^I,\n&amp;b_I^A(I,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\nb_I^A\\circ\\iota_I^A&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathcal P(A))^I},\n&amp;\\iota_I^A\\circ b_I^A&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathcal R_A)_I)},\\\\\nu^{*\\kappa_A}(\\iota_J^A\\psi)&amp;=\\iota_I^A(\\psi\\circ u)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(u:I\\to J,\\ \\psi:J\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_I^A&amp;:(\\mathcal P(A))^I\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathcal R_A)_I),\n&amp;\\iota_I^A(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,\\varphi),\\\\\nb_I^A&amp;:\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathcal R_A)_I)\\longrightarrow(\\mathcal P(A))^I,\n&amp;b_I^A(I,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\nb_I^A\\circ\\iota_I^A&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathcal P(A))^I},\n&amp;\\iota_I^A\\circ b_I^A&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{Ob}((\\mathcal R_A)_I)},\\\\\nu^{*\\kappa_A}(\\iota_J^A\\psi)&amp;=\\iota_I^A(\\psi\\circ u)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(u:I\\to J,\\ \\psi:J\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Examples 4.2.6、5.3.4，尤其 pp.332–334（PDF352–354）。箭头是带源靶的函数，存在实现元只是一项条件；不同实现元不产生不同箭头。相同函数可处于不同谓词 Hom，标签保证全局源靶单值，投影的箭头值与 Set 编码匹配。</p>\n<p>PCA 中的恒等与组合实现给出恒等、复合封闭，范畴律由函数律继承。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_A\">\\(\\kappa_A\\)</span> 的因子条件与一致实现条件在预复合后完全相同，故其为笛卡尔提升；预复合严格保持单位、复合。这指定了 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}\\)</span> 所需的同一分裂。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span> 的唯一严格分类函数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>一致性量词次序是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\forall i\">\\(\\exists a\\forall i\\)</span>；它不等于逐指标选择不同实现元。空指标交明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，故空纤维中的可推导性不依赖不存在的全宇宙交集。分裂泛性按对象字面相等分类，不能据此声称按任意纤维同构唯一分类的普通泛性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-pca","status":"resolved","id":"d5726b47e65d282e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-generic","status":"resolved","id":"2508bee9cd5dcead","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pca","status":"resolved","id":"d5726b47e65d282e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$A\\in\\mathcal U$，$(A,\\cdot)$ 为 [[16-df-pca]] 的 PCA，$\\Omega=\\mathcal P(A)$。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带标签箭头；$\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}$ 采用 [[16-df-split-generic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$A\\in\\mathcal U$，$(A,\\cdot)$ 为 [[16-df-pca]] 的 PCA，$\\Omega=\\mathcal P(A)$。$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]] 的带标签箭头；$\\mathrm{SplitGeneric}$ 采用 [[16-df-split-generic]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-generic","status":"resolved","id":"2508bee9cd5dcead","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$A\\in\\m